{"reference":"Revelation 3","book":"Revelation","chapter":3,"status":"pending","sections":[{"kind":"surrounding_passages","title":"The Seven Messages","blocks":[{"id":"block_1","text":"The evidence does not establish that all seven messages arose from one continuous, empire-wide persecution program. That conclusion remains disputed, so the individual messages should not be assumed to describe one uniform situation behind every church addressed.","provenance_refs":["reader_path_revelation_003_70d74c265db9a6ccab3b24f0"],"confidence":"medium","interpretation_level":"disputed"}]}],"generated_metadata":null}